# Set tokens/ids from your isolated demo environment; replace dates before running.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5299
@headToken = REPLACE_WITH_HEADTRAINER_TOKEN
@trainerToken = REPLACE_WITH_CURRENT_TRAINER_TOKEN
@riderToken = REPLACE_WITH_ASSIGNED_RIDER_TOKEN
@horseId = REPLACE_WITH_HORSE_ID
@templateId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_TEMPLATE_ID
@planId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_PLAN_ID
@sessionId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_SESSION_ID
@riderId = REPLACE_WITH_ACTIVE_RIDER_ID
@startDate = 2026-10-05
@endDate = 2026-10-12
@scheduledAt = REPLACE_WITH_ISO8601_DATETIME_WITH_OFFSET

### HeadTrainer creates a standard template.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/training/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{headToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Endurance","goal":"Build stamina","phase":"Base","distanceMetres":1000,"intensity":"Light","surface":"Sand","frequencyPerWeek":3,"notes":"Standard reference"}

### Assigned Trainer creates a personalized plan; template does not auto-generate sessions.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/training/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"horseId":"{{horseId}}","templateId":"{{templateId}}","goal":"Individual stamina goal","phase":"Base","startDate":"{{startDate}}","endDate":"{{endDate}}","notes":"Individual plan"}

### No Rider means Planned, not Assigned.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/training/plans/{{planId}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"scheduledAt":"{{scheduledAt}}","trainingType":"Trot","distanceMetres":1000,"intensity":"Light","surface":"Sand","target":"Steady effort","notes":"","riderId":null}

### Assign active WorkRider; this rechecks the medical guard.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/training/sessions/{{sessionId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"riderId":"{{riderId}}"}

### Start only within the configured early window and with valid Plan/medical state.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/training/sessions/{{sessionId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Server computes speed in metres/second; duplicate result returns conflict.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/training/sessions/{{sessionId}}/results
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"distanceMetres":1000,"timeSeconds":90,"heartRate":120,"intensity":"Light","feedback":"Completed steadily","abnormalObservation":false}

### Evaluation records intent; adjustFutureSessions=true does not auto-edit the calendar.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/training/sessions/{{sessionId}}/evaluation
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"comment":"Reduce future workload","adjustFutureSessions":true}

### Read explicit session page/size/total; use page 2 for more records.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/training/plans/{{planId}}?sessionPage=1&sessionPageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

### History includes create/edit/start/result/evaluation snapshots.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/training/plans/{{planId}}/history?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
